### AI DJ Copilot - Local Prototype
### Copy to `.env` and adjust as needed.

# Where your K-pop audio files live (directory to scan recursively).
# Example:
# KPOP_SONGS_DIR="/songs/kpop"
KPOP_SONGS_DIR="Songs/kpop"

# Where the SQLite DB lives.
# Example:
# AI_DJ_DB_PATH="data/tracks.db"
AI_DJ_DB_PATH="data/tracks.db"

